t and present, rich and poor, good and bad. This is a city where we see both horsecarts and motorcars, swords and pistols, lords and businessmen.\n\nA wealthy woman from an upper-class family finds herself attracted to a handsome young man, Taka. He and his younger brother seem to be allied, perhaps not entirely willingly, with some of the city's criminal underground (Yakuza). The lady's lovely young maidservant, Sara, meets him too, and a conflict ensues which can only lead to tragedy, passion, and dishonor. But, as events move on, and the days pass, the viewer sees a terrible date coming closer...\n\n(Source: Technogirls)"},"tags":[{"name":"Yakuza","rank":76,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Historical","rank":75,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Love Triangle","rank":73,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Primarily Adult Cast","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Nudity","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Josei","rank":53,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":50,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Trains","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Nightsong of Splendor","english":"Nightsong of Splendor","native":"華星夜曲","romaji":"Kasei Yakyoku","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"华星夜曲"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Gasei Yakyoku"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Starlight Nocturne"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}